# Docker Playwright E2E Skill

Run Playwright E2E tests for the current project inside a shared Docker container (`pw`).

## Invoke
`/docker-playwright` or ask "run playwright in docker"

## Workflow Summary
1. Map host CWD ($HOME/gits/...) to container /work
2. Ensure container `pw` (`mcr.microsoft.com/playwright:v1.59.1-noble`) is running
3. Run `docker exec pw bash -lc "cd '$CPATH' && npx playwright test $ARGS"`
4. Report pass/fail and report host URL (`0.0.0.0`) if tests failed

